---
title: Installation
description: Install Design System UI Svelte items with the shadcn-svelte CLI.
order: 1
---

Install any item from **Design System UI Svelte** with the [shadcn-svelte CLI](https://www.shadcn-svelte.com/docs/cli), passing the item's JSON URL. Each item page shows this command with that item's name already filled in.

Your project must already be set up with [shadcn-svelte](https://www.shadcn-svelte.com/docs/installation). Start with the [`styles`](/docs/styles) registry item so your project has the design system CSS foundation before adding components.

## Optional: use a short alias

By default, shadcn-svelte does not resolve namespaced aliases like `@design-system-ui/button` — you have to pass the full JSON URL every time. To use the shorter alias instead, add a `registries` entry to your project's `components.json`:

```json
{
  "registries": {
    "@design-system-ui": "https://design-system-starter-svelte-docs.vercel.app/r/{name}.json"
  }
}
```

Update the URL to your deployed `homepage` from `registry/config.ts` if you're self-hosting the registry. Once that's set, `npx shadcn-svelte@latest add @design-system-ui/<name>` works in place of the full JSON URL.
